# --- Repo scope: only frontend/ and backend/ are tracked here. ---
# Everything else at the root stays local-only and must NOT be force-added:
#   tools/legacy-migration-audit/config.json  — live legacy SQL Server credentials
#   tools/legacy-migration-audit/reports/     — raw member financial data (PII)
#   tools/**/node_modules/                    — vendored deps, ~250MB
#   tools/archive_scripts/, docs/, dev_backup.sql, .agents/, "full backup"/
# See the conversation with Claude on 2026-09-07 for the reasoning if this
# whitelist is ever revisited.
/*
!/frontend/
!/backend/
!/.gitignore
